# Build output
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. This crate builds a binary, and
# the project pins its own build as strictly as it pins its dependencies.

# Boot images and firmware artefacts
*.img
*.iso
*.efi
/esp/
/build/

# Debug and profiling
*.log
.gdb_history
perf.data*

# Rendered documentation. RFC-0002 commits to publishing docs/ in place with
# mdBook at Phase 4; its default output is book/, and _site/ covers the Pages
# alternative. Ignored now so a first local render cannot be committed by
# accident.
/book/
/_site/

# Local Claude Code state. The committed parts of .claude/ (CLAUDE.md, commands/)
# are shared project configuration; settings.local.json is per-machine.
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/

# Node, only ever present because of markdownlint-cli2
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Secrets — never tracked
.env
.env.local

# Windows artefact from an accidental `> nul`
nul

# Editor and OS noise
# NOTE: .vscode/ is deliberately NOT ignored — extensions.json and settings.json
# are shared project configuration, per the house style.
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
